# ATS Kingston Heath — environment
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; this file is not.

# Web3Forms access key for the enquiry form.
#
# This is a PUBLIC, client-side key by design: everything prefixed VITE_ is
# inlined into the JavaScript bundle at build time and is readable by anyone
# who views source. That is how Web3Forms works — the key identifies the
# destination inbox, it does not authorise anything else. Never put an SMTP
# password, an API secret or a database credential behind a VITE_ prefix.
#
# Obtain the key from https://web3forms.com by entering the destination email
# address. Until it is set, the form validates and reports a controlled error
# instead of sending a request.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
